   (ACIIDS), Ho Chi Minh City, VIETNAM, NOV 28-30, 2022},
Abstract = {Federated learning systems are confronted with two challenges: systemic
   and statistical. Non-IID data is acknowledged to be a primary component
   in causing statistical challenges. To address the federated learning
   system's substantial performance loss on non-IID data, we offer the
   FedMeta-Per algorithm (which combines meta-learning methods and
   personalization layer approaches into a federated learning system). In
   terms of performance and personalization, FedMeta-Per has been shown in
   experiments to outperform typical federated learning algorithm,
   algorithms using personalization layer techniques and algorithms using
   meta-learning in system optimization.},
